1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,820
Black lives don't matter because they are still considered property.

2
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:08,800
Black folks are still considered property.

3
00:00:09,340 --> 00:00:14,940
And we are so blind so often to the ways in which we are being used as property

4
00:00:14,940 --> 00:00:20,840
that we fall right into the hands of the same folks that we know are our oppressors.

5
00:00:20,840 --> 00:00:31,240
And so, you know, I weep for Cyrus and his family and for Carmelo and his family

6
00:00:31,240 --> 00:00:35,240
and them sending their children out thinking that they're going to be safe

7
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:38,940
and them never returning home because people woke up that day

8
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:42,220
with an idea that they were going to take somebody out.

